 SG_ crc8 : 56|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" JETSON_MASTER

BO_ 300 JointTelemetry_SHOULDER_L: 8 SHOULDER_L
 SG_ actual_pos_deg : 0|15@0+ (0.01,0) [0|327.67] "deg" JETSON_MASTER,SAFETY_MCU
 SG_ actual_current_a : 16|11@0+ (0.01,0) [0|20.47] "A" JETSON_MASTER,SAFETY_MCU
 SG_ temp_c : 27|9@0+ (0.5,-20) [-20|235.5] "C" JETSON_MASTER,SAFETY_MCU
 SG_ status_flags : 40|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" JETSON_MASTER,SAFETY_MCU
 SG_ crc8 : 56|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" SHOULDER_L

BO_ 900 SafetyEvent: 8 SAFETY_MCU
 SG_ fault_type : 0|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" JETSON_MASTER
 SG_ fault_value : 8|16@0+ (0.1,0) [0|6553.5] "" JETSON_MASTER
 SG_ sto_triggered : 24|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" JETSON_MASTER
 SG_ timestamp_us : 32|24@0+ (1,0) [0|16777215] "us" JETSON_MASTER
 SG_ crc8 : 56|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" SAFETY_MCU

CM_ BU_ JETSON_MASTER "主控 (P3 决策 PCB, Jetson Orin NX)";
CM_ BU_ SAFETY_MCU "独立看门狗 MCU (STM32G4, 横切安全层 S 的确定性执行器)";
CM_ BO_ 0 "同步帧: 200Hz, 所有关节同一时刻更新目标, 消除通信相位差";
CM_ BO_ 900 "安全事件: 横切安全层 S 的唯一上报通道, 触发即联动 STO";

